@using LouisAgent.Web.Components.Widget
@* The framework Orbi (F164.2): the framework's chat widget, configured once with its identity and the site's words,
   docked beside the page in the docs layout's right column (Louis's pick C), labelled as an AI as the public Orbi is.
   It answers a developer from the docs, so it keeps its work out of sight as the public Orbi does. *@
<ChatWidget Identity="louis-agent-framework" Title="Orbi · AI"
            Greeting="Hi, I'm Orbi, the framework's AI agent. Ask me how louis-agent works, or about the page you're reading."
            Placeholder="Ask about the framework…" ShowWork="false" Layout="WidgetLayout.Docked" OpenLabel="Ask Orbi"
            CloseLabel="Close Orbi" />
